{"id":35317,"date":"2024-05-01T22:54:30","date_gmt":"2024-05-01T21:54:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-sao-macario-2024\/"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:20:14","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:20:14","slug":"trail-sao-macario-2024","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-sao-macario-2024\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail S\u00e3o Mac\u00e1rio 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O GTT.SPS &#8211; Grupo Todo Terreno de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul, vai realizar a 8\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o do S\u00c3O MAC\u00c1RIO ULTRA TRAIL (SMUT), nos pr\u00f3ximos dias 8 e 9 de Novembro de 2025, em Sul, S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>O evento incluiu 4 provas: o ULTRA TRAIL com cerca 49km, o TRAIL com cerca de 29Km, TRAIL SPRINT com cerca de 19Km e o MINI-TRAIL\/CAMINHADA com 9Km. Todos os percursos, incluem trilhos na magn\u00edfica Serra da Arada (S\u00e3o Mac\u00e1rio). No dia 8 de Novembro de 2025 realizar-se-\u00e1 a prova de ULTRA TRAIL e, no dia 9 de Novembro de 2025, as restantes provas.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Todas as provas ter\u00e3o in\u00edcio e fim em Sul.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":38076,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[726,102],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-35317","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sao-pedro-do-sul-viseu","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-viseu","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/663159a485a9f_2416833